1
00:00:00,828 --> 00:00:03,538
(Leonard:)- What's up?
- Well, tonight's my date with Penny.

2
00:00:03,706 --> 00:00:05,796
And we haven't been able to connect
by phone...

3
00:00:05,959 --> 00:00:08,129
- Yeah, I'm sorry. It's been broken.
- Or e-mail.

4
00:00:08,294 --> 00:00:10,794
Yeah, that's broken too.
Everything's broken.

5
00:00:11,589 --> 00:00:15,339
(Stuart:)Anyway, I was just wondering
if you had any last-minute advice.

6
00:00:15,927 --> 00:00:18,927
(Leonard:)All right. Well, off the top of my head...

7
00:00:19,097 --> 00:00:23,137
...you know, I think the most important
thing with Penny is to go really slow.

8
00:00:23,309 --> 00:00:26,019
(Leonard:)I mean, glacial.

9
00:00:26,479 --> 00:00:28,479
(Leonard:)- Okay.
- You know, guys come on to her...

10
00:00:28,648 --> 00:00:32,148
(Leonard:)...all the time, so you need to, like,
set yourself apart, you know?

11
00:00:32,318 --> 00:00:33,898
(Leonard:)Be a little shy.

12
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:37,860
And don't make too much eye contact.

13
00:00:38,032 --> 00:00:40,452
(Leonard:)And you know, treat her with, like,
cool detachment.

14
00:00:40,618 --> 00:00:43,998
(Leonard:)And, you know, fear.

15
00:00:44,163 --> 00:00:45,493
- Fear?
LEONARD: Yeah.

16
00:00:45,665 --> 00:00:50,715
(Leonard:)Like you're afraid
that if you touch her, she'll break.

17
00:00:50,878 --> 00:00:54,048
(Stuart:)Well,
that plays right into my wheelhouse.

18
00:00:54,882 --> 00:00:57,512
(Leonard:)Good, good.
Well, you kids have fun tonight.

